\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> When I was a child I believed. There was always that feeling of quiet joy. Something grand happening. <br /> There were years when, well...we were poor, so gifts weren't always a priority, but that feeling was always there. I suppose it helped that we went to Midnight Mass.<br /> <br /> *sigh*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T17:07:55-08:00","id":349401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/349145-happy-christmas-2014?p=349396#post349396\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"http://cdn.breitbart.com/mediaserver/2012/12/24/CharlieBrownChristmas.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> When I was a child I believed. There was always that feeling of quiet joy. Something grand happening.<br /> There were years when, well...we were poor, so gifts weren't always a priority, but that feeling was always there. I suppose it helped that we went to Midnight Mass.<br /> <br /> *sigh*</div> </div> </div> </div> Reading that reminded me of my family and now I'm a bundle of sappy emotions.<br /> <br /> I remember believing. I remember the years when presents were things scrounged from the backs of dusty closets, hand-me-downs and plastic baubles off the 99 cent rack.<br /> <br /> Believing helped. It gave me a reason to look on the bright side. It gave me courage when I felt cowardly. I don't know where it went, but it left me like it was never there. I miss it, sometimes. A bitter part of me loathes those moments.<br /> <br /> The rest of me just wishes things were simpler, and that I could trust like I did back then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 12-25-2014, 03:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T00:20:59-08:00","id":349675,"title":"","content":"Merry Christmas, everyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":