/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T18:14:43-08:00","id":350216,"title":"","content":"Happy Holidays and whatnot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T18:31:16-08:00","id":350248,"title":"","content":"I was introduced to hard cider today.<br /> <br /> I'm drunk as fuck and happy. I smoked a joint with my grandmother, my aunt, two uncles and my future brother-in-law. A few of them. My sister got me amazing nerdy gifts: a plasma globe, a Silent Bob chibi action figure, a FUCKING LEGO DELOREAN WITH MARTY AND DOC BROWN! And that's just what I remember. She was wearing cat ears that react to her brainwaves the entire time. <br /> <br /> My grandma and mom are helping me back Wraith20 as my gift, and I couldn't be happier. <br /> <br /> I hope all my friends and loved ones here on the forums have had at least half as good a day as I've had. You guys deserve it. <br /> <br /> MERRY XMAS TO ALL, AND I'LL SEE YOU IN THE HATE THREAD ABOUT MY HANGOVER IN THE MORNING! <br /> <br /> &lt;3 y'all are my people. Never forget. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T19:36:06-08:00","id":350308,"title":"","content":"Merry Christmas. I hope the season has been gentle and spent in the company of those who love you for the person you are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T20:06:17-08:00","id":350342,"title":"","content":"Jim that is an awesome sentiment...I couldnt agree more with!<br /> <br /> I was on the &quot;fuck this holiday bus&quot; and just last night adamant on not going anywhere for the holiday... but woke up this morning and begged my fiance to go to his moms as i suddenly didnt want to spend yet another holiday sitting at home just the two of us, couldnt be more happy that i did. <br /> <br /> My mother didnt return my calls or anything but you know what? I dont fucking care if she cant take the time to pick up a phone well why should i cry over it?...my dad i called as he is medicated and often forgets things(so even if he didnt call me today i wouldnt have been upset.) I would have liked to see them today but that wasnt possible.<br /> <br /> <br /> Gifts are not the thing that made my day(they were nice and caught me by surprise), being a part of the family was...and now i'm picking out sentimental gifts for them something i also had not planned to do at all, because fuck, i have the feels and want to get them gifts that have meaning something that shows i do in fact pay attention and care enough to know who they are as people and that i consider them just as much family, just cant wait till the 2nd when i can actually buy and give them to them.<br /> <br /> This is like the first x-mas in years for me that hasnt sucked or made me depressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T06:52:35-08:00","id":350634,"title":"","content":"I've been awake twenty minutes and some change. So far, the forums have decided that I'm in no shape to quote and my drug dealer called me, thinking I was his mother, to wish her/me a Merry Christmas. It took at least a minute to convince him that he had the wrong number, so maybe his mom sounds like a groggy hungover fat dude in morning? The world may never know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moth